{"id":"1e319d8fce454230","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-erdos-rado.md","title":"Erdős-Rado Theorem","display":"thm-erdos-rado — Erdős-Rado Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-erdos-rado","aliases":["17-thm-erdos-rado"],"display":"thm-erdos-rado — Erdős-Rado Theorem","depends_on":["[[17-df-partition-relation]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-2.5.2","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-erdos-rado"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-erdos-rado</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-erdos-rado — Erdős-Rado Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f06a70914e63dea9\" href=\"?note=f06a70914e63dea9\" title=\"17-df-partition-relation\">17-df-partition-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-2.5.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是无限基数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；基数、幂和后继基数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f06a70914e63dea9\" href=\"?note=f06a70914e63dea9\" title=\"17-df-partition-relation\">17-df-partition-relation</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_\\kappa\">\\(b_\\kappa\\)</span> 是下式按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span> 递归定义的基数值函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\mu\">\\(\\lambda,\\mu\\)</span> 为受量化的候选集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nb_\\kappa(0)&amp;:=\\kappa,\\\\\nb_\\kappa(m+1)&amp;:=2^{b_\\kappa(m)}\\quad(m\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\forall\\lambda\\,\\forall\\mu\\;\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,b_\\kappa(n))\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\kappa,n+1)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nb_\\kappa(0)&amp;:=\\kappa,\\\\\nb_\\kappa(m+1)&amp;:=2^{b_\\kappa(m)}\\quad(m\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\forall\\lambda\\,\\forall\\mu\\;\\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,b_\\kappa(n))\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\kappa,n+1)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_\\kappa(n)\">\\(b_\\kappa(n)\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-fold power-set cardinal iteration starting at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; this avoids confusing it with the one-argument global beth function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-partition-relation","status":"resolved","id":"f06a70914e63dea9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-partition-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ 是无限基数，$n\\in\\omega$；基数、幂和后继基数见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。\n$\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S$ 见 [[17-df-partition-relation]]。\n$b_\\kappa$ 是下式按 $m\\in\\omega$ 递归定义的基数值函数；$\\lambda,\\mu$ 为受量化的候选集合。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-partition-relation","status":"resolved","id":"f06a70914e63dea9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ 是无限基数，$n\\in\\omega$；基数、幂和后继基数见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。\n$\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S$ 见 [[17-df-partition-relation]]。\n$b_\\kappa$ 是下式按 $m\\in\\omega$ 递归定义的基数值函数；$\\lambda,\\mu$ 为受量化的候选集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"b_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nb_\\kappa(0)&:=\\kappa,\\\\\nb_\\kappa(m+1)&:=2^{b_\\kappa(m)}\\quad(m\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\forall\\lambda\\,\\forall\\mu\\;\\bigl(&\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,b_\\kappa(n))\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\mu,\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\to\\mathrm{ZfcCombPartitionRelation}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\kappa,n+1)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"b_\\kappa(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1403,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-chain-union]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-erdos-rado]]\n[[17-thm-existential-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-finite-ramsey]]\n[[17-thm-fraisse-limit]]\n[[17-thm-horn-axiomatization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-isomorphic-ultrapowers]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah-predicate-form]]\n[[17-thm-lindstrom]]\n[[17-thm-los]]\n[[17-thm-los-quotient-form]]\n[[17-thm-los-vaught]]\n[[17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski]]\n[[17-thm-model-companion-uniqueness]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-existential-test]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-for